# Cloudflare Pages redirects.  Format: <from>  <to>  <status>
# Any time a route/slug is renamed, add a 301 line here in the SAME task (see CLAUDE.md).
#
# Legal-page long-form URLs → the canonical short slugs this template ships.
# Clients often link the spelled-out forms from email footers, invoices, or old sites.
/privacy-policy           /privacy         301
/privacy-notice           /privacy         301
/terms-of-service         /terms           301
/terms-and-conditions     /terms           301
/tos                      /terms           301
/accessibility-statement  /accessibility   301
